{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14922","headline":"过终南柳处士 · 卢纶","name":"过终南柳处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五老正相寻，围棋到煮金。\n石摧丹井闭，月过洞门深。\n猨鸟三时下，藤萝十里阴。\n绿泉多草气，青壁少花林。\n自愧非仙侣，何言见道心。\n悠哉宿山口，雷雨夜沈沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}